// Every shape Aerie draws in the Contour look (docs/spec/look.md): a person, an outside system,
// leaves, a closed container, open containers at every band depth, and the whole icon set. The
// renderer's screenshots and goldens use it; it is not a real system.

model shapes: Every Contour shape
  > One of each shape and icon, so a change to the look shows up in one picture.

audiences exec "Executive", manager "Manager" (default), engineer "Engineer" (code)

visitor: Visitor | A person, drawn as a pill [person]
  @engineer: | role: visitor

outside: Outside service | Hatched, off the edge of the map [external]
  @engineer: | https://example.org/api

ground: Ground | An open container at depth 0 [system]
  ridge: Ridge | An open container at depth 1 [system]
    crest: Crest | At depth 2 [system]
      summit: Summit | At depth 3 [system]
        peak: Peak | Deeper still, on the depth 3 band [system]
          cairn: Cairn | A leaf at the very top
            @engineer: | cairn.ts
          shed: Shed | A closed container [system]
            rake: Rake | Inside the shed
            spade: Spade | Inside the shed

icons: Icons | The whole v1 icon set [system]
  people: People and screens [system]
    i-person: person | Head and shoulders
      icon person
    i-web: web | A browser window
      icon web
    i-monitor: monitor | A screen on a stand
      icon monitor
    i-api: api | Lines in, an arrow out
      icon api
    i-route: route | A point with an arrow leaving
      icon route
  work: Work [system]
    i-gear: gear | A cog
      icon gear
    i-module: module | A cube
      icon module
    i-stack: stack | Three stacked layers
      icon stack
    i-dice: dice | A die showing five
      icon dice
    i-refresh: refresh | Two arrows chasing round
      icon refresh
  keeping: Keeping [system]
    i-cylinder: cylinder | A storage drum
      icon cylinder
    i-grid: grid | A table
      icon grid
    i-document: document | A page, folded
      icon document
    i-archive: archive | A box with a lid
      icon archive
    i-books: books | Books on a shelf
      icon books
  places: Places [system]
    i-building: building | An office block
      icon building
    i-search: search | A magnifying glass
      icon search
    i-history: history | A clock turning back
      icon history
    i-box: box | The default
      icon box

visitor walks up to cairn
  @engineer: GET /cairn from
cairn calls on outside
cairn keeps tools in shed
rake leans on spade
i-person uses i-web
i-web shows on i-monitor
i-monitor calls i-api
i-api forwards to i-route
i-gear turns i-module
i-module sits on i-stack
i-stack rolls i-dice
i-dice asks for i-refresh
i-cylinder fills i-grid
i-grid prints i-document
i-document goes in i-archive
i-archive sits by i-books
i-building holds i-search
i-search finds i-history
i-history keeps i-box

view shapes: Shapes
  show visitor, ground +5, outside

view icon-set: Icons
  show icons +2

scenario visit: A visit
  visitor walks up to cairn
  cairn calls on outside
  outside answers cairn
  cairn keeps tools in shed
  rake leans on spade
